			<item>
				<title>We were at the GRADE finale in Warsaw!</title>
				<link>https://kskpd.pl/en/blog/we-were-at-the-grade-finale-in-warsaw/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kskpd.pl/en/blog/we-were-at-the-grade-finale-in-warsaw/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;On 8 October, we were in Warsaw for the finale of &lt;strong&gt;COST GRADE — Grassroots of Digital Europe&lt;/strong&gt;. A conference, workshops and the “Bits Behind the Curtain” exhibition, plus a chance to meet people working on the history of computers and digital cultures. We had a great time!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Poznań&#39;s Museum of Digital Culture</title>
