			<item>
				<title>Dataset</title>
				<link>https://kskpd.pl/en/projects/dataset/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kskpd.pl/en/projects/dataset/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone! We’re excited to share the results of our latest research—the unified demoscene dataset. It contains fundamental information on over 600,000 demoscene productions gathered from major archives like &lt;a href=&#34;https://demozoo.org&#34;&gt;Demozoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://pouet.net&#34;&gt;Pouët&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://csdb.dk&#34;&gt;CSDb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://ada.untergrund.net&#34;&gt;ADA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://janeway.exotica.org.uk&#34;&gt;Kestra/BitWorld&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://speccy.pl&#34;&gt;Speccy.pl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;http://atariki.krap.pl&#34;&gt;Atariki&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&#34;http://zxart.ee&#34;&gt;ZXArt&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
